      "content": "Hey, I'm planning a documentary trip to the Caucasus region soon to film some local festivals and culture. Given the political tension there right now, I'm trying to map out which political groups or movements are generally considered \"moderate\" and \"stable\" to work with, and which ones are seen as more \"radical\" or \"extremist\" that I should probably avoid for the sake of my safety and getting good footage?",
